      "content": "\"stop fighting the emptiness\"... you mean like just giving up? i've been trying to fight for so long and it's just making me more miserable. do you think it's actually better? to just stop trying to exist in a world that doesn't even want you? it feels like the only way to actually get some peace is to just... disappear for real.",
